# Replace teamId with an existing team's ID.
@teamId = 1

### Create a user (201 Created)
# @name createUser
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Researcher",
    "teamId": {{teamId}}
}

### Fetch the created user (200 OK)
GET {{createUser.response.headers.Location}}

### Unknown user (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/0

### Unknown team (404 Not Found)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Researcher",
    "teamId": 9223372036854775807
}

### Reject a blank name (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "teamId": {{teamId}}
}
